r=#FFFFFF;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1170" y="430" width="120" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ptools" value="&lt;b&gt;Passage tools&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Container: Python on Lambda]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;SV-005 · SBB-005&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="430" width="130" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g-data" value="&lt;b&gt;Records and projections&lt;/b&gt;  &lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;SBB-001 Lake on S3; SBB-003 Knowledge graph on Amazon Neptune; SBB-004 Passage index on Bedrock Knowledge Base with S3 Vectors&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F7FB;strokeColor=#B9C6D9;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5A6A86;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=3;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="600" width="1000" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lake" value="&lt;b&gt;Lake&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Container: S3 bucket, DN-001: landing, bronze, silver, gold, ontology, index, ledger]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;ST-001 to ST-010, ST-016 · SBB-001&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=12;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="630" width="410" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="neptune" value="&lt;b&gt;Knowledge graph&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Container: Amazon Neptune, DN-010: a named graph per document per version]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;ST-008 · SBB-003&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=12;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="630" width="200" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="kb" value="&lt;b&gt;Passage index&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Container: Bedrock Knowledge Base, S3 Vectors, DN-011]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;ST-006 ST-007 · SBB-004&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=12;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="630" width="140" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g-build" value="&lt;b&gt;Build and provisioning&lt;/b&gt;  &lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;SBB-009 Image build on CodeBuild and ECR; SBB-010 Terraform module with the CloudFormation launch stack&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F7FB;strokeColor=#B9C6D9;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5A6A86;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=3;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="810" width="1000" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="build" value="&lt;b&gt;Image build&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Container: CodeBuild projects and ECR repositories, DN-003 DN-013]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;ST-017 · SBB-009&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D9AD6;fontColor=#1B2A4A;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="840" width="280" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tf" value="&lt;b&gt;Terraform module and launch stack&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Container: Terraform 1.14, CloudFormation, DN-013]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;CT-010 · SBB-010&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D9AD6;fontColor=#1B2A4A;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="840" width="320" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="buildnote" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;The module provisions every unit on this page. The image build produces the pipeline and agent images (ST-017) that the sweep and the chat agent run.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1B2A4A;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="840" width="310" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bedrock" value="&lt;b&gt;Models and guardrail&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[External: Amazon Bedrock or the Anthropic API, DN-011]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;SBB-012&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#999999;strokeColor=#8A8A8A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="600" width="180" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="backends" value="&lt;b&gt;Optional projection backends&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[External: Neo4j, Apache AGE or MongoDB, DN-015]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;ST-015 · SBB-011&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#999999;strokeColor=#8A8A8A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="790" width="180